    "summary": {
      "plain": "Jefferson Lab's campus in Newport News, Virginia, home to the CEBAF electron accelerator and its four experimental halls; this pass draws the campus boundary and the CEBAF Center building, and lists CEBAF itself as not yet geometrically located after an Overpass outage cut the session short."
    },
    "type": "map",
    "unlocated": [
      {
        "backlog": "Re-run `python scripts/atlas_osm_extract.py --map jefferson-lab --bbox 36.968,-76.445,36.993,-76.415 --filter 'way[\"tunnel\"=\"yes\"]' --filter 'way[\"name\"~\"CEBAF|Hall A|Hall B|Hall C|Hall D\",i]'` once Overpass is reachable; cross-reference results against the building numbers in src:geo-jlab-site-plan-detail (999=Accelerator Tunnel, 101=Hall A, 94=Hall B, 96=Hall C, 203=Hall D) and the sourced total tunnel length ('7/8 of a mile', ~1,408 m, per src:geo-jlab-node-14330-cebaf-page and src:geo-jlab-accelerator-unique-page) as a length check once a shape is found.",
        "entity_id": "accelerator:cebaf",
        "entity_name": "Continuous Electron Beam Accelerator Facility",
        "entity_type": "accelerator",
        "reason": "Both permitted Overpass mirrors (overpass-api.de and lz4.overpass-api.de) became unreachable ('Connection refused' on every attempt, including a 10-minute, ~30-attempt background poll of overpass-api.de/api/status) partway through this session, after BNL's geometry had already been extracted but before any Jefferson Lab query could run. No other fetched source gives a georeferenced trace of CEBAF's racetrack tunnel: Jefferson Lab's own site-plan document (src:geo-jlab-site-plan-detail) names the tunnel ('999 Accelerator Tunnel') and its four experimental halls ('101 Experimental Hall A', '94 Experimental Hall B', '96 Experimental Hall C', '203 Experimental Hall D') and shows their layout in an aerial photo, but that photo is not itself georeferenced (no scale bar or coordinate grid), so tracing shapes from it by eye would not be a sourced geometry per the research contract.",
        "sources": [
          "src:geo-jlab-site-plan-detail",
          "src:jlab-accelerator-page"
        ]
      }
